# Ru 0.21.3 editing lexer and conservative structural folding, in pure Ru.
# Source of truth: rulang/frontend.py and language-spec.md at public dd6cb81b.
# Styles: 0 plain, 1 comment, 2 string, 3 number, 4 keyword, 5 type,
#         6 builtin, 7 punctuation/operator, 8 name, 9 invalid character/escape.
# No dependency on Python, Win32, Lexilla or another language lexer at runtime.
# Unicode tables below were generated from Python 3.12 / Unicode 15.0.0
# str.isalpha()/str.isalnum(), exactly the pinned frontend's predicates.
# Keep inclusive endpoint pairs in small scalar-text pages. This reduces GC
# roots and avoids >128 literal alternatives in native ABI static analysis.
算 _制区 文 为 句:
    列 取 [].
    位 取 0.
    长 取 文 其 量.
    循
        若 位 >= 长 则 破. 然
        末 取 位+128.
        若 末 > 长 则 末 取 长. 然
        列 其 增 文[位:末].
        位 取 末.
    环
    得 列.
